   00228| // Live Wiktionary fallback (issue #221). When the offline meaning
   00229| // registry above does not cover `surface`, fetch the Wiktionary page
   00230| // for `source` and pull the first `{{tt+|<target>|...}}` (or `{{t+}}` /
   00231| // `{{t}}`) entry. Mirrors the Rust pipeline's Stage 1a in
   00232| // `src/translation/pipeline.rs`: if the main page delegates noun
   00233| // translations via `{{see translation subpage|...}}`, fetch the
   00234| // subpage and search it first. Keeps the worker mobile-friendly: no
   00235| // offline dictionary bundled, just a single CORS-safe HTTP call.
